        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Salve Patriarcharum decus, et Ecclesiae sanctae Dei Oeconome, cui panem vitae et frumentum Electorum conservasti.",
          "english": "Hail, glory of the Patriarchs, steward of God’s holy Church, who didst preserve the Bread of Life and the Wheat of the Elect.",
