        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "A Septuagesima usque ad Pascha, loco Alleluia, dicitur Laus tibi, Domine, Rex aeternae gloriae.",
          "english": "During Lent until Easter, instead of the alleluia the following is said Praise to Thee, O Lord, King of everlasting glory.",
