          "source": "Ant. (Lc 2:4) Ascendit Ioseph a Galilaea de Nazareth, in Iudaeam in civitatem David, quae vocatur Bethlehem, cum Maria desponsata sibi uxore praegnante.",
          "english": "Ant. (Lk 2:4) Joseph went up out of Galilee from Nazareth into Judea, to the city of David, which is called Bethlehem, with Mary his espoused wife who was with child.",
