          "source": "In florentis hortum mentis, amas Iesum ducere: da, florescat et mitescat, hortus animae.",
          "english": "Souls retiring, sweet, and humble, thou dost still for Jesus seek: that my heart may be his garden, make it humble, pure and meek.",
